      "question": "Sensory functions",
      "preferredVariantId": "v-ee50ded8f8",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "v-ee50ded8f8",
          "answer": "Anterolateral distal leg and most dorsum of foot, excluding first web space and usually lateral border; toe tips/nail beds are mainly plantar nerve territory.",
